    "body": "**Problem:** #31043 removed the `verbose` alias from `getorphantxs`, but all three result headings in its help still use that name. Following the help and passing `verbose=1` returns `Unknown named parameter verbose`.\n\n**Fix:** Use the accepted argument name, `verbosity`, in all three labels.\n",
